# Phase 1 — Daily Operational Synchronization

## Objective
Align inventory reality with advertising execution daily.

---

# Morning Huddle Process

Every morning:
- Marketing Ops
- Inventory Team
- Meta Ads Team

conducted a short operational sync to discuss:
- inventory movement
- high-stock categories
- low-stock exclusions
- campaign priorities
- top-performing sizes

---

# Daily Catalog Scrub

## Method
Cross-reference:
- consolidated inventory heatmap
- category size sales reports
- marketplace sales reports

to identify:
- low-stock variants
- high-stock categories
- fast-moving SKUs
- zero-sale inventory

---

# Operational Rule

If any size/SKU had:
```text
< 10 Units Available
```

that product variation was:
- excluded from Meta catalog feeds
- paused from active campaigns
- removed from promotional visibility

---

# Business Objective

Prevent:
- wasted clicks
- poor customer experience
- bounce due to unavailable sizes

---

