# Phase 3 — Size-Based Creative Strategy

## Objective
Improve ad relevance using inventory and sizing data.

---

# The “Size-Hook” Strategy

Instead of generic ad messaging:

```text
"Buy Kidswear"
```

ads were redesigned using inventory-specific messaging:

```text
"Party Wear Frocks now available in Sizes 22–26. Flat 25% Off."
```

---

# Why This Worked

Parents scrolling Meta could instantly identify:
- size availability
- category relevance
- urgency

This improved:
- click-through rate
- ad relevance
- conversion intent

---

# Featured Sizes Prioritized

Based on sales velocity reports:
- Size 22
- Size 24
- Size 26

were identified as high-performing sizes and highlighted in creatives.

---

# Visual Urgency Strategy

Ad creatives included:
- limited stock messaging
- size availability overlays
- “while stock lasts” messaging
- dynamic discount visibility

